    "A native stream invocation registry WouldBlock remains authority-busy inside the original command deadline; missing and poisoned entries remain forbidden. The existing retry precedes Core work, so no routing effect is replayed.",
    "Capture the bounded native target/source reads under one Store connection interval and the existing original command authority. Validate that original attempt before and after capture. Every source retains its original individual audience/scope/expiry checks; forbidden sources remain absent and other failures return no partial snapshot. SQL custody ends before Core/IO and no new authority interval is acquired. Single-read callers share the same extracted validation code.",
    "Tracked source172 patch retries lifecycle proposal sealing only if the original observer remains live and its pre-IO permit/binding/budget was lost. Cancel and release all proposal custody before fresh observation and policy. Definitive policy denial and retired origins still stop the observer; malformed deliveries are not masked as contention.",
    "The controlled QUIC regression uses one actual packet and a synchronous1100ms metadata stall without a reader. Fresh authorization must produce ready/opened on the same original route without another packet, offer or registration.",
    "Server HTTP/OpenAPI extensions and native lifecycle/subscription guides describe the metadata boundary. Store schema remains103."
